  "details": "Right now with the new name plate design and all. I find the status colours quite hard to read due to its size. And when some post processing is added as well. \n\nCan't we get a small shape or something to them now for readability?\n\nBlue = circle, Green = triangle, Orange = square and Red = 45 degree rotated square is some examples. But integrating a black line in one of them would make them stand out as well.\n\nSomething like this would make it way easier for players with colour vision deficiency.",
